Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:01:25.98,0:01:26.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:02:57.03,0:02:57.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:13:57.02,0:13:57.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
