Comment: 50,0:23:52.99,0:23:53.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:22.88,0:00:25.67,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since I've been in the human world!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.01,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,Gotta use my transformation device.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.48,0:00:42.31,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,Hmm, is this human enough?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.31,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.82,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,It's shopping time!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:49.99,0:00:51.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm leaving now!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.82,0:00:53.28,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.87,0:00:57.91,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}If anyone finds out about her magic,{technically either of them but her last lines in 14 suggest she's far more worried about this happening to fuu than herself}
Dialogue: 50,0:00:57.91,0:01:01.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}she'll be taken to the prison of souls.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.38,0:01:04.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Azuki, did you know about this?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.46,0:01:08.67,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I didn't know either.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:08.67,0:01:09.42,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.97,0:01:11.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:13.47,0:01:15.72,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Rui, you're going to be late!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:16.43,0:01:17.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I-I'm going!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:18.77,0:01:19.85,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Dad!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:19.85,0:01:21.48,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.94,0:01:25.98,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,That's strange. Rui doesn't usually\Nwait until the last minute.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.54,0:03:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,See you next week!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.13,0:03:12.84,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll have to give today's gig my all!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.22,0:03:14.84,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Kadoya!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.84,0:03:16.01,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Shota!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.05,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.27,0:03:24.85,Default,Girl 1,0,0,0,,Shota-kun!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.14,0:03:28.77,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Good going, Shota! Nice pass!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.77,0:03:29.73,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.32,0:03:37.74,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,And so once again...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.74,0:03:40.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,through a sorrowful conflict...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.24,0:03:42.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,a flower of mystery falls.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.74,0:03:43.75,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Rui?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.37,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,What's she doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.58,0:03:48.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,And so once again...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.38,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Nonoyama!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.50,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Shota-kun! You had club today?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.50,0:03:56.30,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Yeah. We have a game tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.30,0:03:57.72,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.47,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.39,0:04:02.64,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.64,0:04:04.14,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.06,0:04:08.77,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,The plum blossoms have bloomed.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.23,0:04:11.02,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,They have.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.36,0:04:12.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,How pretty.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.69,0:04:16.90,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,So, Nonoyama, if you're free tomorrow...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.78,0:04:21.03,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,would you... like to come watch my game?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.08,0:04:26.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I have singing lessons—
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I mean, plans tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.38,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Uh, I wasn't talking to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.46,0:04:36.76,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Oh no, Rui turned into a stranger!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.97,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Rui?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll be on my way, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.55,0:04:43.10,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.97,0:04:46.10,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Shota, let's go home.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.64,0:04:49.85,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Who's that guy? What were you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.85,0:04:52.23,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,That's what {\i1}I'm{\i0} wondering.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.32,0:04:56.86,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Rui, wait up!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.86,0:04:58.44,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What is it, Azuki?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.44,0:05:00.03,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Look in the mirror!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.03,0:05:01.57,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The mirror?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.16,0:05:06.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh? I turned into a stranger!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.74,0:05:09.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Is this someone's magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.42,0:05:14.00,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,You're back to normal!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.42,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What's happening here?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.42,0:05:20.01,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Ah! I have to get to the shoot.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.10,0:05:31.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Will I be able to transform?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.19,0:05:33.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Letto.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.16,0:05:49.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila pululila,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.83,0:05:52.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,pop'n pam!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.45,0:06:24.57,Default,Rui/Azuki,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.49,0:06:31.58,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,Is the device broken?\NI turned back so quickly.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.25,0:06:37.34,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.84,0:06:43.59,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,There's a place with real good pot stickers up ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.85,0:06:51.10,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,She's late.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.06,0:06:55.10,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.31,0:06:57.56,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.52,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Have you seen Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.52,0:07:01.53,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm right here...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.07,0:07:06.11,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now I'm a staff member?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.11,0:07:07.74,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um, I mean...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.32,0:07:12.75,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lulu-san just told us that she got sick.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.75,0:07:16.12,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,What?! But we're about to start filming!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.12,0:07:17.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.54,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,I need you to go find a stand in immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.96,0:07:21.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,U-Understood!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.25,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.17,0:07:27.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What do I do? I can't look for a stand in.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.59,0:07:30.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Even if I become Lulu again,\NI still can't go back.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.64,0:07:33.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I should at least reach out to Toko-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.81,0:07:42.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Azuki, what should I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.48,0:07:44.24,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,This is tricky.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.74,0:07:48.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for lying!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.66,0:07:52.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,My apologies. I came down very sick.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.33,0:07:54.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I won't be able to make it to today's shoot.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.87,0:07:55.83,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.83,0:07:58.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.21,0:08:00.79,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.79,0:08:03.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Do they have a stand in?\NShould I go?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.34,0:08:06.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I asked the staff to search for one.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.47,0:08:09.84,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.35,0:08:18.19,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.40,0:08:22.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I haven't found anyone yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.82,0:08:25.15,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,You look very familiar.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.11,0:08:28.28,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Are you perhaps the stand in?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.61,0:08:30.91,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.24,0:08:33.58,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Let's have you read a few lines.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.58,0:08:35.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.17,0:08:42.21,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you sure we should have her\Nstand in on short notice?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.21,0:08:44.25,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Well, she already knows her lines.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.71,0:08:47.01,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Try acting it out.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.76,0:08:53.89,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,And so once again...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.89,0:08:56.14,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,through a sorrowful conflict...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.39,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,a flower of mystery falls.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.64,0:09:01.60,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.90,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,I think she'll do.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.03,0:09:07.61,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This can't be good...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.61,0:09:09.15,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.15,0:09:10.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Should I go in her place?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.53,0:09:16.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,They found a stand in for Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.37,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Already?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.37,0:09:20.66,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,That was fast. And I was still looking for one.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.66,0:09:21.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Were you?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.50,0:09:27.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"I must say, watching..."
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.00,0:09:30.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"Watching you search for the culprit..."
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.51,0:09:32.43,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um, good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.43,0:09:33.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Morning! Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.43,0:09:39.06,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Lulu-san got sick and can't come in,\Nso this girl is filling in for her, I believe.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.06,0:09:42.39,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I'll be in your care for the day.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.10,0:09:44.52,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm L—
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.31,0:09:46.65,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,N-Nonoko.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.65,0:09:49.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Nonoko-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.07,0:09:49.90,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Pleased.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.49,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,I'm Tachibana.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.49,0:09:55.07,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Must be tough to fill in on the spot.\NLet's all do our best.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, let's!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.53,0:09:59.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Though, I really hope Lulu-chan is okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.16,0:10:02.96,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A-All good! Don't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.96,0:10:04.04,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.04,0:10:07.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Th-That's what the staff told me before!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.46,0:10:09.84,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,She just needs to rest up.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.84,0:10:12.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. That's a relief.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.72,0:10:15.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,By the way, Nonoko-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.18,0:10:16.05,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.35,0:10:20.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Those glasses are adorable!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.27,0:10:23.85,Default,AD,0,0,0,,We're ready to roll.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.86,0:10:27.73,Default,Director,0,0,0,,The drama we're filming today
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.07,0:10:31.36,Default,Director,0,0,0,,is a school suspense set in a private high school.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.82,0:10:36.24,Default,Director,0,0,0,,One day the headmaster goes missing,\Nplunging the school into chaos.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.24,0:10:38.53,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Now there's no more classes.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.53,0:10:42.33,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Then, a student sets out\Nto find the truth behind this mystery.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.33,0:10:45.54,Default,Director,0,0,0,,The student body president\Nand detective, played by Nonoko-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.54,0:10:46.21,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.54,0:10:49.92,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Her best friend, and secretly\Nthe perpetrator, played by Lilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.92,0:10:51.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I understand!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.42,0:10:54.72,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Tachibana-kun will play the headmaster's son.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.72,0:10:57.39,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Rin-san will be his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.39,0:10:58.18,Default,Tachibana/Rin,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.85,0:11:02.73,Default,AD,0,0,0,,We'll start from scene 25!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.56,0:11:06.35,Default,AD,0,0,0,,Ready, action!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.27,0:11:09.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You think {\i1}I{\i0} did it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.65,0:11:12.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But I'm your best friend!\NDon't you trust me?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.19,0:11:17.32,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Yeah! She would never kidnap the headmaster.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I have evidence.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.04,0:11:27.67,Default,Tachibana/Rin,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.00,0:11:31.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I didn't want to believe it either.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.21,0:11:35.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But I can't change the truth.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.97,0:11:43.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Welp, you've figured me out!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.56,0:11:49.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I must say, watching you search for the culprit\Nwhile standing right next by was quite enjoyable!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.78,0:11:56.45,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Cut!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.74,0:12:00.28,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Your delivery feels a bit childish.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Childish?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.83,0:12:04.95,Default,Director,0,0,0,,The character has a lot of darkness in her heart.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.95,0:12:08.46,Default,Director,0,0,0,,I'd like her to show some sorrow\Nfor betraying her best friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.63,0:12:13.30,Default,AD,0,0,0,,We'll be starting again.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.09,0:12:18.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Watching you search for the culprit\Nwhile standing right next by...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.35,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,was quite enjoyable.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.18,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Too dark.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.10,0:12:28.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Watching you search for the culprit\Nwhile standing right next by...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,was {\i1}quite{\i0} enjoyable!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.90,0:12:34.94,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.94,0:12:38.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wa-Watching you s-search for the c-culphrit...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.41,0:12:42.07,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.91,0:12:46.33,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Who would've known Lilly\Nwould be more problematic than the stand in.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.79,0:12:53.09,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.46,0:12:54.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nonoko-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.34,0:12:58.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry, I kept messing up takes.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.05,0:13:06.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm not like this when I'm singing.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.06,0:13:10.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Do you like singing?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.94,0:13:13.61,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah! I love it. It's so much fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.02,0:13:15.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What about acting?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.23,0:13:17.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I kinda suck at it.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.57,0:13:20.61,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But I try my best!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.82,0:13:23.37,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.37,0:13:27.79,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Why do you try so hard, Lilly-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.50,0:13:36.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Probably because it's frustrating.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.80,0:13:38.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I decided to do this,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.21,0:13:41.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,and I'd hate it if it ended here.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.13,0:13:46.89,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But what if you get hurt in the process?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.31,0:13:52.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter, as long as I get\Nto come out of it saying, "I had a blast!"
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.48,0:13:56.44,Default,AD,0,0,0,,Filming will resume soon!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.03,0:14:03.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It needs to feel sorrowful...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.49,0:14:07.03,Default,AD,0,0,0,,Now, scene 26, action!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.03,0:14:09.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Why would you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.83,0:14:12.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,How could you kidnap the headmaster?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.21,0:14:15.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Because of tests...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.54,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I hate tests so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.30,0:14:19.30,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.30,0:14:22.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No more headmaster means no more tests!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.93,0:14:24.68,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,That's why you did it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.68,0:14:26.05,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Just awful.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.18,0:14:30.18,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Some of us were looking forward to our tests!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.68,0:14:32.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please stop this.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.23,0:14:35.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You can still fix things!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.27,0:14:39.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's too late! I'm doomed.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You realize whose fault this is.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.57,0:14:46.41,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Good, good!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.41,0:14:48.74,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Lilly just has to nail these next lines!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.74,0:14:51.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I lost everything because of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.70,0:14:55.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Tests, my happy school life,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.92,0:14:58.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,and my best friend!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.63,0:15:01.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.59,0:15:06.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,don't expose me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.89,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,For a villain, she's a bit...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.44,0:15:21.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,When did things turn out like this?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.11,0:15:27.78,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Oh my...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.78,0:15:29.95,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,I feel bad for her.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.95,0:15:31.83,Default,Director,0,0,0,,This is a kind of sorrow too!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.83,0:15:33.08,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.41,0:15:36.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,C-Cry all you want.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.08,0:15:39.08,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,H-Hey, tell us something.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.59,0:15:42.17,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Is the headmaster... Is my dad okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.17,0:15:45.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. I left him at his house.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.26,0:15:50.43,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! So classes can resume tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.27,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,That's a huge relief!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.27,0:15:55.27,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Let's go home and study.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.27,0:15:57.02,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Yeah! I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.02,0:15:58.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're kidding...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.15,0:16:06.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I wish I hadn't learned the truth,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.78,0:16:09.53,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,but it's only human nature to seek it out.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.28,0:16:12.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,And so once again...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,through a sorrowful conflict...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.25,0:16:17.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,a flower of mystery falls.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.38,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Cut!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.38,0:16:25.67,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,How was it? It's a bit different\Nfrom the direction you were aiming for.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.63,Default,Director,0,0,0,,This works even better.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.63,0:16:31.51,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Doesn't it? It really makes me\Nwant to protect her.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.51,0:16:32.76,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.76,0:16:36.64,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Once she got really into the role,\Nit started to feel believable.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.64,0:16:38.77,Default,Director,0,0,0,,That's a wrap!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.94,0:16:42.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.91,0:16:53.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm heading home now.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.83,0:16:55.62,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,See you again, Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.08,0:16:57.96,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Good work to you too, Nonoko-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.37,0:17:00.62,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,That final scene went great.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.62,0:17:03.21,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,I got really sucked into it too!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.21,0:17:06.21,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,You two perform well under pressure.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.21,0:17:07.21,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.72,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.22,0:17:19.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm glad the drama went well, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.39,0:17:23.36,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm still stuck as Nonoko.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.11,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I haven't turned back yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.70,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It won't work.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.20,0:17:38.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Hey, Azuki.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.62,0:17:42.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,How do I turn back to my normal self?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.00,0:17:44.38,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.92,0:17:48.38,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,This is tough. I can't go home.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.13,0:17:53.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.39,0:17:55.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.18,0:17:59.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Are you the actress Nonoko-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.73,0:18:02.52,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,U-Umm, yes, that's me.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.52,0:18:04.61,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd run into you here!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.61,0:18:06.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Do you live in this area?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.94,0:18:08.03,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.03,0:18:11.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I thought all entertainers\Nlived farther away!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.86,0:18:13.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,My name's Fuu!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.82,0:18:16.78,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I live near here too, at a confectionery shop!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.33,0:18:18.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Furyu?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.45,0:18:20.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You know about us?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.58,0:18:24.37,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, can I ride the swings with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.37,0:18:25.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.33,0:18:26.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.88,0:18:31.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nonoko-chan, you see...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.97,0:18:35.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I actually like cake better.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.14,0:18:36.09,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.47,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I-I had no idea.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.47,0:18:41.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Well, cake's cooler than traditional confections.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.85,0:18:44.44,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I-I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.44,0:18:46.36,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Traditional confections are lovely too.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.81,0:18:49.61,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really? They're pretty plain to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.44,0:18:53.11,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Kohaku-tou candies are pretty, for example.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.45,0:18:55.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You know a lot!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.53,0:18:57.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,If you say so, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.41,0:19:02.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You're very energetic, Fuu-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.87,0:19:05.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Just like the person I look up to.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.62,0:19:07.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.17,0:19:12.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm probably not like that person.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.84,0:19:16.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I struggle a lot, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.80,0:19:20.64,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.85,0:19:25.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Like, I can't talk to my big sis that well.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.60,0:19:28.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's gotten better recently,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.73,0:19:31.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,but we used to be better friends when we were little.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.36,0:19:34.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We'd sing together.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.15,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.03,0:19:41.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I wish we could chat a bunch just like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.33,0:19:49.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nonoko-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.92,0:19:53.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.84,0:19:55.84,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.40,0:20:11.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,See you! I live down this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.73,0:20:14.03,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay! Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.65,0:20:16.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll be cheering you on!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.91,0:20:25.50,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Rui, you're turning back to normal!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.54,0:20:27.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.34,0:20:34.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm so tired...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.38,0:20:38.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Why was today like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.18,0:20:40.26,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,It was very rough.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.09,0:20:43.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Was there some sort of magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.14,0:20:46.27,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Not just on me.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.27,0:20:50.35,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,All of a sudden, everyone else\Nhas been transforming too.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.31,0:20:56.28,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Even Lilly-san, Toko-san and the rest...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.07,0:21:00.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Maybe Fuu really is just Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.20,0:21:03.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't tell anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.79,0:21:05.99,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Uguisu!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.41,0:21:07.75,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,You're sleeping again?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.75,0:21:10.29,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,We're cats. It's what we do.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.29,0:21:13.88,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Guess what? I think Rui stopped playing detective!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.88,0:21:14.71,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.71,0:21:15.34,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.34,0:21:18.38,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. I saved the day.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.38,0:21:19.59,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.59,0:21:22.39,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,By saying we should leave her be.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.39,0:21:23.85,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.77,0:21:29.77,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please, don't transform anymore today.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.48,0:21:36.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry, Uguisu!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.28,0:21:39.15,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Wipe him off.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.57,0:21:40.95,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.33,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.33,0:21:46.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.03,0:21:48.50,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm still bothered by that song,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.58,0:21:51.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}but...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.42,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}as long as Fuu's smiling, that's all that matters.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.84,0:22:00.38,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,I got a good haul!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.38,0:22:03.39,Default,Umezo,0,0,0,,Time to go home to Felix Star.
Comment: 50,0:02:57.03,0:03:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rui's Seven Transformations
Comment: 50,0:07:48.66,0:07:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Toko-san
Comment: 50,0:08:30.91,0:08:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower of Mystery - Script
Comment: 50,0:21:59.38,0:22:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Temporarily Closed
Comment: 50,0:23:52.99,0:23:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A Sudden Gourmet Battle
