Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.96,0:01:44.83,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Let's blow it all away{蹴散らしてゆこう}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.84,0:01:48.17,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}My daily routine's getting boring{退屈な日常}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.17,0:01:51.76,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}But when I met you it started swingin'{キミと出会った瞬間Swingin'}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.43,0:01:55.35,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}The time began to fly{時が走り出すよ}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.76,0:01:59.35,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Enjoying the nightlife, my heart racing{跳ねる心臓の夜遊び}
