Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.44,0:02:08.98,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Swingin' magic
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.98,0:02:11.11,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Don't leave me{話さないで}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.11,0:02:13.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Swingin' magic
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.83,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Just dance the way you feel{感じるままに踊れば}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.83,0:02:18.74,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}And the joy will only grow{ときめきもっと増えるよ}
